(2) Repealed: 2020, c. 11, Sched. 5, s. 10.
(3) Every assessment officer has jurisdiction to assess costs in a proceeding in any court.  ;
(4) Where costs of a proceeding before a tribunal other than a court are to be assessed by an assessment officer,
